ebsite and learn things at ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com\/","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-2.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The whole design system is documented and available online. You can find everything about components, tokens, guidelines and principles of OUDS.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icon finder"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is also available there to get icons for your projects.","type":"text"}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Have a look ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki","type":"reference"},{"text":" to discover how OUDS works.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-3.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS iOS provides also a wiki attached to its GitHub repository. The wiki is a public base of knowledge with plenty of things: available API, technicala architecture, tips about processes, tests, conventions and toolings.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the source code of this showcase app, go to its dedicated GitHub repository at "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"}]}],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-4.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For technical reasons the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"reference"},{"text":" GitHub repository does not embed the source code of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"design system toolbox"}]},{"type":"text","text":" app. In fact this app and all its snapshots for tests increases a lot the size of the repository."}]}],"code":null},{"runtimePreview":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not hesitate to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/issues"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}]}],"type":"step","media":"tutorial-discovery-6-5.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is open source, public and uses GitHub as forge. Thus, you will find common things inside the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" GitHub repository."}]}],"code":null}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"},"metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Going further with more resources","category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"project"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS":{"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/use-of-first-components-provided-by-ouds","type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS","kind":"article","abstract":[],"title":"Use of first components provided by OUDS"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios/discussions":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/discussions","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"open or participate to discussions"}],"type":"link","title":"open or participate